# Verdict Check-in

1. Run `selves due` (optionally `selves due --today YYYY-MM-DD` for a demo simulation).
2. For each due session, write `$SELVES_HOME/sessions/<id>/95_checkin.md` — a short, kind
   question to {{ owner }} plus a link to the outcome form
   (`$SELVES_BRAIN_URL/?session=<id>#checkins`).
3. Raise a ClawMax notification asking {{ owner }} to record how it turned out.

When {{ owner }} records the outcome, it is written to `council_records`, `asof_now` and
`timeline`, so the next council's Historian can cite which self was right.
